:{"id":"p37dea46286b1-item-1c74b3f9d8fcd1a53f02","person_id":"p37dea46286b1","title":"","units":[]},"p37dea46286b1-item-93e7789ee800216c09fe":{"id":"p37dea46286b1-item-93e7789ee800216c09fe","person_id":"p37dea46286b1","title":"","units":[]},"p37dea46286b1-item-9b9d57ec03835715079e":{"id":"p37dea46286b1-item-9b9d57ec03835715079e","person_id":"p37dea46286b1","title":"四月三十日慈孝寺山亭席上口占送子敦都運待制赴河北","units":[{"id":"p37dea46286b1-item-9b9d57ec03835715079e-part-01","status":"automatic","work_id":"p37dea46286b1-text-7edc9c1064631d827665","title":"四月三十日慈孝寺山亭席上口占送子敦都運待制赴河北"}]},"p37dea46286b1-item-54084bf15762e5bc9d72":{"id":"p37dea46286b1-item-54084bf15762e5bc9d72","person_id":"p37dea46286b1","title":"","units":[]},"p37dea46286b1-item-4d77f6ff458330d41ec0":{"id":"p37dea46286b1-item-4d77f6ff458330d41ec0","person_id":"p37dea46286b1","title":"","units":[]},"p37dea46286b1-item-0a5ab8f5bff17e9dbca0":{"id":"p37dea46286b1-item-0a5ab8f5bff17e9dbca0","person_id":"p37dea46286b1","title":"","units":[]},"p37dea46286b1-item-b047006b46d036d73d1d":{"id":"p37dea46286b1-item-b047006b46d036d73d1d","person_id":"p37dea46286b1","title":"","units":[]},"p37dea46286b1-item-d7a69b197530ec654d48":{"id":"p37dea46286b1-item-d7a69b197530ec654d48","person_id":"p37dea46286b1","title":"","units":[]}},"works":{"p37dea46286b1-text-49738f79201cd3280723":{"id":"p37dea46286b1-text-49738f79201cd3280723","person_id":"p37dea46286b1","title":"秋月二首  其一","titles":["秋月二首  其一"],"text":"孤枕夜何永，破窗秋已寒。\n雨聲衝夢斷，霜氣襲衣單。\n利劍摧鋒鍔，蒼鸇縮羽翰。\n平生衝斗氣，變作淚汍瀾。"},"p37dea46286b1-text-85b3a28f7200c1625820":{"id":"p37dea46286b1-text-85b3a28f7200c1625820","person_id":"p37dea46286b1","title":"秋月二首  其二","titles":["秋月二首  其二"],"text":"秋夜不可晨，悲歌聊自永。\n頫聽一掀簾，星河光烱烱。\n霜浮萬瓦寂，月滿四山靜。\n壯心隨北風，吹入單于境。"},"p37dea46286b1-text-7edc9c1064631d827665":{"id":"p37dea46286b1-text-7edc9c1064631d827665","person_id":"p37dea46286b1","title":"四月三十日慈孝寺山亭席上口占送子敦都運待制赴河北","titles":["四月三十日慈孝寺山亭席上口占送子敦都運待制赴河北"],"text":"送客城南寺，蕭然雲水秋。\n客意在萬里，聊作須臾遊。\n昨夜過新雨，清風滿梁州。\n簪裳合俊彥，河圖並天球。\n古來功名人，未就不肯休。\n譬如鑿空使，尚致安石榴。\n矧今南畝氓，往往東西流。\n君能安輯之，千倉與萬輈。"}}}
